<title>POLAND: AGROS AUG NET FALLS TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>AGROS AUG NET FALLS TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.05 vs   1.61</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.69 vs   2.19</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.49 vs   1.40</p>
<p> Sales		    6.02 vs  11.60</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	    17.04 vs  11.74</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	24.07 vs  18.22</p>
<p> Operating profit    14.56 vs  11.29</p>
<p> Sales		   69.10 vs 102.57</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish food trader and producer is</p>
<p>Agros SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
